莱特问黄泉：“山路能走吗？明早在哪里会合？”\"}],\"actors\":{\"player\":\"御临风\",\"bright\":\"布莱特\",\"huang\":\"黄泉\"},\"facts\":{\"clinic.owner.xuelao.old-friend\":{\"effectiveAt\":{\"id\":\"legacy.story.order\",\"clock\":\"turn\",\"at\":0,\"actorId\":\"legacy.story\"},\"discoveryConditions\":[\"actual-receipt\"],\"dependencyRefs\":[],\"id\":\"clinic.owner.xuelao.old-friend\",\"entityId\":\"clinic.owner\",\"field\":\"relationship\",\"value\":\"九雪医馆馆主与雪老有旧，二者是不同的人。\",\"certainty\":\"confirmed\",\"visibility\":\"private\"},\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.4d7ef7259f483f472e71d1fe6f22a4f08c0341032f592fe4ac4a8ade92887bd2.message\":{\"effectiveAt\":{\"id\":\"legacy.story.order\",\"clock\":\"turn\",\"at\":12,\"actorId\":\"legacy.story\"},\"discoveryConditions\":[\"actual-receipt\"],\"dependencyRefs\":[],\"id\":\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.4d7ef7259f483f472e71d1fe6f22a4f08c0341032f592fe4ac4a8ade92887bd2.message\",\"entityId\":\"bright\",\"field\":\"reported_message\",\"value\":{\"kind\":\"reported_message\",\"speakerId\":\"bright\",\"text\":\"寻常医馆若只是抓药看诊，前堂的学徒或伙计接了方子就能办。\"},\"certainty\":\"uncertain\",\"visibility\":\"private\"},\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.d6bdce8c3df89fc42064161b1a2cd5485ce245dc8855323a9dff8c60a2d1d95b.message\":{\"effectiveAt\":{\"id\":\"legacy.story.order\",\"clock\":\"turn\",\"at\":12,\"actorId\":\"legacy.story\"},\"discoveryConditions\":[\"actual-receipt\"],\"dependencyRefs\":[],\"id\":\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.d6bdce8c3df89fc42064161b1a2cd5485ce245dc8855323a9dff8c60a2d1d95b.message\",\"entityId\":\"bright\",\"field\":\"reported_message\",\"value\":{\"kind\":\"reported_message\",\"speakerId\":\"bright\",\"text\":\"不过村医写的是举荐你求医求学的信，这算熟人之间的托付。前堂的人多半不敢擅自拿主意，即便接了信，最后也得转交到馆主手里，由他亲自过目。\"},\"certainty\":\"uncertain\",\"visibility\":\"private\"},\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.313b5e1b5e85f266f052a9981dae175809257449a1159b5a5c9e964e2124487d.message\":{\"effectiveAt\":{\"id\":\"legacy.story.order\",\"clock\":\"turn\",\"at\":12,\"actorId\":\"legacy.story\"},\"discoveryConditions\":[\"actual-receipt\"],\"dependencyRefs\":[],\"id\":\"dialogue.84ce040523c7049bfe86990805584b69d70ecfa893b79b7aefadb76c1c049461.313b5e1b5e85f266f052a9981dae175809257449a1159b5a5c9e964e2124487d.message\",\"entityId\":\"bright\",\"field\":\"reported_message\",\"value\":{\"kind\":\"reported_message\",\"speakerId\":\"bright\",\"text\":\"先递给门前接待的人引荐即可。馆主若是愿意见，自然会出来同你说话；若是有急诊在忙，也得看他们里头的安排。\"},\"certainty\":\"uncertain\",\"visibility\":\"private\"}},\"memory\":null,\"contextRef\":\"88975d1f8fb4eb5a7c1dd17418f86a6831cbd62fb11363d61550e92cc9dd7137\"},\"recoveryAttempted\":false,\"attempts\":[{\"status\":\"validated\",\"rawReply\":\"{\\\"schemaVersion\\\":\\\"dialogue-reception/7\\\",\\\"contextRef\\\":\\\"88975d1f8fb4eb5a7c1dd17418f86a6831cbd62fb11363d61550e92cc9dd7137\\\",\\\"selections\\\":[{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f2\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"黄泉\\\"},{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f1\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"山路已经封闭了，明早在渡口会合。\\\"},{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f2\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"答道\\\"},{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f1\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"山路已经封闭了\\\"},{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f5\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"布莱特\\\"},{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f5\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"只听清前半句\\\"},{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f4\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"明早在渡口会合\\\"},{\\\"fragmentId\\\":\\\"f6\\\",\\\"quote\\\":\\\"后半句被钟声盖住\\\"}],\\\"utterances\\\":[{\\\"speakerId\\\":\\\"huang\\\",\\\"speaker\\\":0,\\\"content\\\":1,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"asserted\\\",\\\"scope\\\":{\\\"time\\\":null,\\\"condition\\\":null,\\\"attribution\\\":null},\\\"anchor\\\":2}],\\\"receptions\\\":[{\\\"utterance\\\":0,\\\"content\\\":3,\\\"listenerId\\\":\\\"bright\\\",\\\"identityKind\\\":\\\"explicit\\\",\\\"identity\\\":4,\\\"historyMessageId\\\":null,\\\"evidenceKind\\\":\\\"direct\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":5,\\\"propositionRef\\\":null},{